[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4881701386","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120927#issuecomment-4881701386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120927","id":4881701386,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIvjaCg","user":{"login":"Linnnnnn42","id":39369724,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MzY5NzI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39369724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42","html_url":"https://github.com/Linnnnnn42","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-04T10:58:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T10:58:54Z","body":"I'm trying to fix it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4881701386/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4886865260","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120927#issuecomment-4886865260","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120927","id":4886865260,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI0elbA","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-05T17:14:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T18:13:07Z","body":"Similarly, I also constantly get `Previewed Line must be inisde the fragment() function.` as an error for lines that ARE within the fragment function, after I have added a new line somewhere in the shader. Whether that is a comment, an empty line or a CTRL-Z, they all cause the previews to stop working. The `Update` button doesn't help, only adding a new preview or removing one of the previews causes them all to update.\n\n<img width=\"734\" height=\"289\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0539b2dd-b18e-4fd2-a561-3d2d33b950f1\" />\n\nThis also happens if I simply adjust the value that needs to be displayed on the line.\n\n<img width=\"734\" height=\"158\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8cabbb50-c6f3-494b-be27-b9cf4c3095aa\" />\n\n\nAnother way to offset the previews is to move the line itself down. \n\n<img width=\"734\" height=\"289\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed57c60a-92ce-4c7d-8124-22f8c4f81ee8\" />\n\nThe previews seem to attach themselves to the first character on the line (including whitespace), so whenever you move your code, but the whitespace stays on the original line, the preview stays and now previews an empty line. It probably should be changed to follow the first non-whitespace character, so it behaves more consistently and in-line with expectation\n\nSince all of this seems to have to do with what is and isn't included in the parser, this could be caused by the fact that I have several #include files or macros set up.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4886865260/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4887126972","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120927#issuecomment-4887126972","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120927","id":4887126972,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI0ujvA","user":{"login":"Linnnnnn42","id":39369724,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MzY5NzI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39369724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42","html_url":"https://github.com/Linnnnnn42","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-05T18:23:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T18:23:49Z","body":"> Similarly, I also constantly get `Previewed Line must be inisde the fragment() function.` as an error for lines that ARE within the fragment function, after I have added a new line somewhere in the shader. Whether that is a comment, an empty line or a CTRL-Z, they all cause the previews to stop working. The `Update` button doesn't help, only adding a new preview or removing one of the previews causes them all to update.\n> \n> <img alt=\"Image\" height=\"289\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10502115/617253845-0539b2dd-b18e-4fd2-a561-3d2d33b950f1.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..DkstvdDWhGbn0GURDQb5djB0RW_gBE_WekJooEqjvJM\">\n> Another way to offset the previews is to move the line itself down.\n> \n> <img alt=\"Image\" height=\"289\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10502115/617254460-ed57c60a-92ce-4c7d-8124-22f8c4f81ee8.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..AIwd8gWDxmYli4lvDTsg-asRr2IxuVleRAWYzHya8s8\">\n> The previews seem to attach themselves to the first character on the line (including whitespace), so whenever you move your code, but the whitespace stays on the original line, the preview stays and now previews an empty line. It probably should be changed to follow the first non-whitespace character, so it behaves more consistently and in-line with expectation\n\nI've tried to fix the first problem you encountered. It now works like this:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc17ffca-b3ad-4d06-b9b9-2770c1ab15ed\n\nHowever, i think the manual refreshing problem is independent of the problem described in the current issue.\nYou may open a new issue for it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4887126972/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4887202859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120927#issuecomment-4887202859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120927","id":4887202859,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI0zMKw","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-05T18:48:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T18:48:10Z","body":"Looks great! From the video it seems like both the additional linebreaks and adjusting the value on a preview line now work properly, which is going to make the previews feel a lot more consistent! Thanks!\n\nThe linebreak added on a preview line is a more minor issue, since that happens way less and can be worked around by simply added a linebreak above or below anyway.\n\n> However, i think the manual refreshing problem is independent of the problem described in the current issue.\n\nIf you're referring to the note that the update button doesn't work once the previews break and show an incorrect error, that was more additional context than a problem to fix! I suppose it technically is a bug, but never really use the update button anyway, so that's fine!\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4887202859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4888878078","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120927#issuecomment-4888878078","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120927","id":4888878078,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI2Zb_g","user":{"login":"Linnnnnn42","id":39369724,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MzY5NzI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39369724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42","html_url":"https://github.com/Linnnnnn42","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T03:39:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T03:39:48Z","body":"@Arecher I'm referring to this: \n\n> The Update button doesn't help, only adding a new preview or removing one of the previews causes them all to update.","autho