ibute one change at a time.\"](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#contribute-one-change-at-a-time) But technically, the cause of this bug is different from the bug mentioned in the current issue, although they do interfere with each other. Maybe we should ask the maintainers.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4889212406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4889399713","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120927#issuecomment-4889399713","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120927","id":4889399713,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI25RoQ","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T05:30:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T05:30:06Z","body":">If I only fix the manual update issue, it will work like this: after saving with Ctrl+S, the shader preview will automatically update, but in the wrong way\n\nThat makes sense. If the comments still cause the previews to look at the wrong line, updating them won't show the correct result. But at least they'd update! Together with your other changes, the previews should show and update correctly.\n\nI think all of these changes are addressing the overall issue of the shader previews not working and updating consistently, so grouping them into a single PR shouldn't be a problem. Especially since that only avoids future merging troubles, and if you're looking at the functionality right now, might as well fix whatever you can!\n\nIf the maintainers want you to make changes or exclude certain fixes, they'll let you know when they do a code review, I'm guessing! ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4889399713/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]